@startuml act_search
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam SwimlaneWidth same
|User|
start
:Enter query in search bar;
|System|
if (Query empty?) then (yes)
  :Do not submit;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Start latency timer;
if (Query starts with "#"?) then (yes)
  :Match normalised hashtag;
elseif (Query matches a module code?) then (yes)
  :Match module code;
else (keyword)
  :Full-text match on title, slides and hashtags\nplus module name, programme and user name;
endif
:Restrict to notes visible to the user;
|User|
if (Apply filters?) then (yes)
  :Choose "Lecturer content only"\nand/or published date range;
  |System|
  :Add filter conditions to query;
else (no)
endif
|System|
:Execute indexed query;
:Order notes by text relevance, then ranking score;
:Return Notes and People tabs;
:Log response time (target < 3 s, NFR1);
if (Any results?) then (no)
  :Show "No results" with active filters;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|User|
:Open a note or profile from the results;
stop
@enduml
